00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:40.583
The main reason why I started to get
an MBA from Stanford was because I

00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:46.040
wanted to do also something with
education or social entrepreneurship.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:51.290
And so I actually discover when I was
doing my research about MBA programs that

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:56.970
Stanford allow you to do an MBA and
a master's in education at the same time.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:02.220
So I applied to both and
I completed both in 2016.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:06.434
But that was one of the main reasons
before I even fell in love with

00:08:06.434 --> 00:08:08.241
the culture of the school.

00:08:08.241 --> 00:08:13.760
