where you could be who you were,

00:08:21.882 --> 00:08:25.480
and you really could follow
what you were passionate about.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:29.567
And that was the main reason,
my love for education and management.

00:08:29.567 --> 00:08:34.317
And then the culture and
the people at the school.

00:08:34.317 --> 00:08:37.860
&gt;&gt; Excellent, thank you for that.

