00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.945
So that was really, really nice.

00:09:46.677 --> 00:09:50.870
&gt;&gt; My reasons were somewhat similar to
Juan's ones, but slightly different.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:56.920
So I was in South Africa, I had been
outside of Latin America maybe ten years.

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:00.808
