pursuing a career in Latin America?

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:28.026
What were some of the opportunities
at the GSB that helped you with that?

00:11:32.652 --> 00:11:34.094
&gt;&gt; I don't know if Juan wants to start.

00:11:34.094 --> 00:11:37.896
But for me, most importantly the network,

00:11:37.896 --> 00:11:43.975
