Latin American students at the GSB.

00:11:43.975 --> 00:11:48.290
I mean, there are quite a few,
but you end up knowing them all.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.157
And so it's really,
really easy to build that bridge.

00:11:51.157 --> 00:11:55.835
So my husband is also a GSB alum and
recently he was looking for

00:11:55.835 --> 00:11:59.343
a country manager for
his company in Mexico.

00:11:59.343 --> 00:12:03.540
