I would just go to
the rain processions and

00:27:43.778 --> 00:27:48.657
ask them in my case,
it has been fairly responsive.

00:27:48.657 --> 00:27:51.519
Not everyone, but most.

00:27:51.519 --> 00:27:57.184
So,
&gt;&gt; In my case,

00:27:57.184 --> 00:28:01.141
I'm, I won't say that the community
