00:28:01.141 --> 00:28:06.068
I would say indirectly because I've had,
they helped me with top processes,

00:28:06.068 --> 00:28:08.326
like what change should I make now?

00:28:08.326 --> 00:28:12.940
But I think I've made some pretty big
switches in my career, even after the MBA.

00:28:12.940 --> 00:28:16.749
So I started at AB InBev
in their ZX ventures,

00:28:16.749 --> 00:28:22.177
which is their new product development or
how you want to call it.

00:28:22.177 --> 00:28:25.645
Then I switched,
I became the CMO of a tech startup and

00:28:25.645 --> 00:28:29.820
have knowing nothing about tech and
I have never worked in tech.

00:28:29.820 --> 00:28:32.005
And I became the CMO of a tech startup.

00:28:32.005 --> 00:28:36.624
And I think part of the reason I
could make that change was because of

00:28:36.624 --> 00:28:40.994
