00:28:55.831 --> 00:28:59.079
So I think it gives you credibility.

00:28:59.079 --> 00:29:02.222
And that really helps during your career,

00:29:02.222 --> 00:29:06.248
especially if you want to
make some different changes.

00:29:06.248 --> 00:29:09.316
And then the community
helps in different ways.

00:29:09.316 --> 00:29:12.585
For example, for them,
it was fundraising for me.

00:29:12.585 --> 00:29:15.522
It's more like opening opportunities and

00:29:15.522 --> 00:29:19.854
